  "question": {
    "text": "A thin circular disk is in the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math> plane as shown in the figure. The ratio of its moment of inertia about&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;axes will be:<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5b586212-ba6e-4596-9b65-dfe4f2f06fe9-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 184px;\" />",
